NOTE ON NAMES AND LIKENESSES

This licence covers the ORIGINAL code and assets in this repository: the game
engine, the procedurally generated app icon, the procedurally drawn fighters,
stages and effects, the runtime-synthesised audio, and the original story
campaign.

Character names, technique names and related terminology reference well-known
third-party series for a private prototype. Those names are the property of
their respective rights holders and are NOT licensed by this file. No
copyrighted artwork, sprites, logos, screenshots, music or voice recordings
from any third party are included in this repository.

Every asset path in the roster data (`portrait`, `spriteSet`, `audioSet`) is a
plain relative string, so names and artwork can be replaced without changing
any game logic.
